            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.10.48

- Fixed Chrome extension communication with the native app by moving localhost requests into an extension service worker.
- Preserved strict YouTube Music origin validation and a narrowly scoped localhost permission.
- Bundled Chrome extension 1.3.0 so real queue diagnostics can reach the native app reliably.
]]></description>
