            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.10.47

- Expanded the Chrome extension’s YouTube Music queue reader with rendered Up Next rows.
- Removed the misleading self-cover substitution when adjacent artwork is unavailable.
- Added a local diagnostic timeline for private queue APIs, playlist state, rendered rows, and resolution paths.
- Bundled Chrome extension 1.2.0 for precise adjacent-artwork troubleshooting.
]]></description>
